   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Whitaker Peace and Development Initiative (WPDI) - Piggery Farm Project</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Project Name: Piggery Farm Project.Location: Juba.Summary: Shalom Piggery Farm Ltd seeks to fill the gap in the pork industry in Juba. The project seeks to rear 600 pigs within the first year to meet the demand for pork products in Juba and reduce the demand for imported pork meat from Uganda.</narrative>
  </description>
